      "lines": [
        "$3\\frac{2}{5}\\cdot2=(3+\\frac{2}{5})\\cdot2=3\\cdot2+\\frac{2}{5}\\cdot2=6+\\frac{4}{5}=6\\frac{4}{5}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "804",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "804. 正方形的边长$\\frac{7}{8}$米，求正方形的面积."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "805",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "805. 一公斤糖果值$\\frac{4}{5}$卢布，$\\frac{3}{4}$公斤，$\\frac{5}{4}$公斤糖果各值多少",
        "卢布？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "806",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "806. 计算：",
        "1) $\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot\\frac{5}{7}$； 3) $\\frac{2}{5}\\cdot\\frac{7}{11}$； 5) $-\\frac{3}{7}\\cdot(-\\frac{1}{2})$；",
        "2) $\\frac{1}{8}\\cdot\\frac{3}{4}$； 4) $\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{11}{3}$； 6) $\\frac{4}{5}\\cdot(-\\frac{2}{3})$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "807",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "807. 求积：",
        "1) $\\frac{4}{7}\\cdot\\frac{5}{6}$； 3) $\\frac{2}{5}\\cdot\\frac{3}{2}$； 5) $\\frac{15}{16}\\cdot\\frac{5}{9}$； 7) $-\\frac{2}{5}\\cdot\\frac{1}{4}$；",
        "2) $\\frac{11}{12}\\cdot\\frac{8}{9}$； 4) $\\frac{11}{5}\\cdot\\frac{3}{5}$； 6) $\\frac{12}{5}\\cdot\\frac{9}{16}$； 8) $-\\frac{1}{8}\\cdot(-\\frac{8}{11})$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "808",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "808. 求下列各式的值：",
        "1) $\\frac{3}{8}\\cdot\\frac{6}{15}$； 3) $\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot\\frac{3}{2}$； 5) $\\frac{32}{7}\\cdot\\frac{77}{8}$； 7) $-\\frac{5}{6}\\cdot\\frac{12}{25}$；",
        "2) $\\frac{5}{9}\\cdot\\frac{6}{6}$； 4) $\\frac{6}{5}\\cdot\\frac{5}{2}$； 6) $\\frac{26}{17}\\cdot\\frac{68}{13}$； 8) $\\frac{4}{7}\\cdot(-\\frac{21}{16})$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "809",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
